  },
  "holistic_F_N": 0,
  "holistic_F_H": 0,
  "section_notes": "S1 is safe with 24h reporting/notice and no confirmed-cause delay. S2 sets 55°C/5% but allows sales under corrective action, with results to customers/regulators but not public. S3 is weakened by a 24-month new-unit deadline though retrofit is 72 months; S4 is acceptable with validated equivalent at 36 months; S5 is weakened by open-ended corrective action at the 8/100k trigger."
